Included with permission confirmed by Anima's maintainer on 2026-10-11.
Upstream declares no public license for the glyph artwork. The glyph data is
separate from Anima's Apache-2.0 Rust implementation; no broader glyph license
is asserted here. Upstream's MIT tokenizer notice does not license this artwork.
No tokenizer, token text, song material, font, or upstream rendering code is included.

accelerando-glyphs.bin contains 8192 little-endian u64 bitmaps in glyph-ID order.
Each bitmap occupies a 7x7 pixel grid, bit (y * 7 + x), with the original
orientation preserved. Original coordinates 0, 1, 2 map to pixels 0, 3, 6.
Regenerate with: python3 demo/import_accelerando.py /path/to/accelerando-8192
